## `widget-form.spec.ts` (mandatory cases)

Copy `frontend/src/app/vehicles/vehicle-form.spec.ts` structure verbatim (`fill(type, index, value)`,
`select(value)`, `submit()`, `errors()`, `afterEach(() => http.verify())`) and cover:
